        {
          "text": " Kicorakis ituŋa ebe, “Naianyuniata asaduku naka aitutuket naka EJAKAIT Ekusideke, ka isasedotin Ilebin edakitos ŋes, inyounete do kaiboisiokus, kotupasi ŋes. ",
