        {
          "text": " Kotema Yosua isasedotin atiar, “Kodakata asaduku naka aitutuket, kiŋarenikis ituŋa adokar.” Apotu kodakata asaduku naka aitutuket, kiŋarenikis ituŋa alosit.",
